# 64, 64, 1, 1, 64, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 1,
# E20-6: the chip grid carries ONLY the batch, so weight is broadcast to every chip and
# the NoP multicast spanning tree is the path that prices it. A mapping that partitions
# every datatype across chips never reaches that branch at all -- the first attempt at
# these fixtures did exactly that and silently covered nothing.
